{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51974","headline":"西江月（六首。以下词）（原八首，前二首已见《全唐诗》，此六首，《全宋词》亦未收。） 五 · 吕岩","name":"西江月（六首。以下词）（原八首，前二首已见《全唐诗》，此六首，《全宋词》亦未收。） 五","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"水火运法周岁，四六勿错如初。\n水多火少失功夫，胜地方始安炉。\n直须认鼎与药，却如鸡子无殊。\n内黄外白结凝酥，一颗圆明汞珠。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"吕岩","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51974.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51974","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}